# Nations and land claims (design/data/nations.toml, nations/*.js, FTB Teams + FTB Chunks). `ttl nation expect <bot> <field>
# <value>` prints "ttl: ..." when it does not hold, which `server.sh test-all` counts as a failure. A refusal is checked
# with `try_found_<name> <reason>` (runs the real action and answers ok or the reason), never by running the failing command.
# Needs the economy (`ttl econ give|expect`) and the reputation package (`ttl rep bonus`). Numbers: charter 50 gold = 5000
# bronze, base 4 chunks a soul + 10 a nation member (+2 at Village), party cap 5 (ftbteams-server.snbt), claims only in the
# overworld (ftbchunks-world.snbt whitelist). The bots keep their FTB party and data between runs, so everything is reset first.
# Parties are FTB's own, run as the bot typed them: `ttl as <bot> ftbteams party create|invite|join|leave` (`execute as` cannot:
# Brigadier checks FTB's player-only `requires` against RCON while parsing). `join` takes the inviter's name, not the party's.
# A, B: nation 1 (A owner). C: a Life 1 bot (cannot claim in the Mortal Realm). D, E: nation 2 (D owner). F: the sixth.
# Expect in the log: "[ttl] nations: TtlBotNatA founded TtlBotLand", "[ttl] nations: TtlBotNatA extra claim chunks 0 -> 6",
# "[ttl] nations: TtlBotLand is now a Village", and no "[ttl] nations command failed" / "nations: ... failed".
ttlbot spawn TtlBotNatA
ttlbot spawn TtlBotNatB
ttlbot spawn TtlBotNatC
ttlbot spawn TtlBotNatD
ttlbot spawn TtlBotNatE
ttlbot spawn TtlBotNatF
@sleep 2
# Clean slate: forget the nations (the parties stay), members leave first, then the owners (an empty party vanishes).
ttl nation test TtlBotNatA drop
ttl nation test TtlBotNatD drop
ttl nation test TtlBotNatB leaveparty
ttl nation test TtlBotNatC leaveparty
ttl nation test TtlBotNatE leaveparty
ttl nation test TtlBotNatF leaveparty
ttl nation test TtlBotNatA leaveparty
ttl nation test TtlBotNatD leaveparty
ttl nation test TtlBotNatA nolife2
ttl nation test TtlBotNatB nolife2
ttl nation test TtlBotNatC nolife2
ttl nation test TtlBotNatD nolife2
ttl nation test TtlBotNatE nolife2
ttl nation test TtlBotNatA noboss1
ttl nation test TtlBotNatD noboss1
ttl nation test TtlBotNatA clearextra
ttl nation test TtlBotNatB clearextra
ttl nation test TtlBotNatC clearextra
ttl nation test TtlBotNatD clearextra
ttl nation test TtlBotNatE clearextra
clear TtlBotNatA
clear TtlBotNatD
ttl nation sync
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA member no
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA life2 no
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA extra 0
# Refusals in order: Life 1 -> no party -> too few members -> no boss stage -> bad name -> too poor -> fine.
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA try_found_TtlBotLand life2only
ttl nation test TtlBotNatA life2
ttl nation test TtlBotNatB life2
# Into the overworld only now: a Life 1 soul there is sent back to the Mortal Realm at once (life/confine.js).
execute in minecraft:overworld run tp TtlBotNatA 100 100 100
execute in minecraft:overworld run tp TtlBotNatB 102 100 100
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA try_found_TtlBotLand noparty
ttl as TtlBotNatA ftbteams party create TtlBotNatParty
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA try_found_TtlBotLand members
ttl as TtlBotNatA ftbteams party invite TtlBotNatB
ttl as TtlBotNatB ftbteams party join TtlBotNatA
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatB try_found_TtlBotLand notowner
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA try_found_TtlBotLand stage
ttl nation test TtlBotNatA boss1
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA try_found_x name
ttl econ give TtlBotNatA 4999
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA try_found_TtlBotLand fee
ttl econ give TtlBotNatA 1
# Founding: the fee is taken (a sink), both members get the stages and the Hamlet allowance (10 - base 4 = 6 extra each).
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA try_found_TtlBotLand ok
ttl econ expect TtlBotNatA balance 0
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA try_found_TtlBotLand exists
ttl discord expect TtlBotNatA nation 1
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA member yes
ttl discordroles TtlBotNatA dry expect nation
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA owner yes
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatB member yes
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatB owner no
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA name TtlBotLand
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA members 2
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA rank hamlet
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA rankstage_hamlet yes
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatB rankstage_hamlet yes
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatB life2 yes
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA extra 6
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatB extra 6
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA maxclaims 20
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA score_min 0
execute as TtlBotNatA run ttl nation
execute as TtlBotNatA run ttl nation top
# VALUE: members' renown + holdings. 100 bonus renown each lifts the nation to Village (150); the rank adds 2 chunks a member.
ttl rep bonus TtlBotNatA 100
ttl rep bonus TtlBotNatB 100
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA value_min 200
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA rank village
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA rankstage_village yes
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA rankstage_hamlet no
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA extra 8
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatB extra 8
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA maxclaims 24
execute as TtlBotNatA run ttl nation value
# Land: claims work in the overworld and count as holdings; a Life 1 bot cannot claim in the Mortal Realm.
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA claims 0
execute as TtlBotNatA run ftbchunks claim
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA claims 1
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA chunks 1
execute in ttl:mortal_realm run tp TtlBotNatC 0 100 0
execute as TtlBotNatC run ftbchunks claim
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatC claims 0
# Treasury: anyone pays in, only the owner takes out; deposits and withdrawals are not faucets or sinks.
ttl econ give TtlBotNatA 300
execute as TtlBotNatA run ttl nation deposit gold 1
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA treasury 100
ttl econ expect TtlBotNatA balance 200
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatB try_withdraw_gold_1 notowner
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA try_withdraw_gold_5 funds
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA try_withdraw_silver_5 ok
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA treasury 50
# Upkeep: 1 silver (10 bronze) a claimed chunk and week, from the treasury; what it cannot pay stays owed.
ttl nation test TtlBotNatA upkeep
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA treasury 40
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA owed 0
execute as TtlBotNatA run ttl nation withdraw silver 4
ttl nation test TtlBotNatA upkeep
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA treasury 0
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA owed 10
# Unpaid upkeep (owner 18/11/2026, nations.toml [upkeep.debuff], weeks = 2): one unpaid week is only a warning; the
# second puts the nation at stage 1 (Neglect) inside its land, where A stands on the claimed chunk. A deposit pays the
# debt from the treasury at once and lifts it (the claims are never taken).
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA owedweeks 1
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA debuff 0
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA debuff_here 0
ttl nation test TtlBotNatA upkeep
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA owed 20
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA owedweeks 2
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA debuff 1
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA debuff_here 1
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA yield_here 0.75
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA growth_here 0.25
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA claims 1
execute as TtlBotNatA run ttl nation info
execute as TtlBotNatA run ttl nation deposit gold 1
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA owed 0
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA treasury 80
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA owedweeks 0
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA debuff 0
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA debuff_here 0
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA yield_here 1
# Nation 2 (D owner, E member) for diplomacy.
ttl nation test TtlBotNatD life2
ttl nation test TtlBotNatE life2
execute in minecraft:overworld run tp TtlBotNatD 300 100 100
ttl nation test TtlBotNatD boss1
ttl econ give TtlBotNatD 5000
ttl as TtlBotNatD ftbteams party create TtlBotNatParty2
ttl as TtlBotNatD ftbteams party invite TtlBotNatE
ttl as TtlBotNatE ftbteams party join TtlBotNatD
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatD try_found_TtlBotLandTwo ok
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA members 2
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatD members 2
# An alliance holds when both owners offer it; a war cannot be declared on an ally, and counts after the notice window.
execute as TtlBotNatA run ttl nation ally TtlBotLandTwo
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA ally_TtlBotLandTwo no
execute as TtlBotNatD run ttl nation ally TtlBotLand
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA ally_TtlBotLandTwo yes
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatD ally_TtlBotLand yes
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA try_war_TtlBotLandTwo allied
execute as TtlBotNatA run ttl nation unally TtlBotLandTwo
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA ally_TtlBotLandTwo no
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA war_TtlBotLandTwo none
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatB try_war_TtlBotLandTwo notowner
ttl discord expect TtlBotNatA war 0
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA try_war_TtlBotLandTwo ok
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA war_TtlBotLandTwo pending
ttl discord expect TtlBotNatA war 1
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatD war_TtlBotLand pending
ttl nation test TtlBotNatA warnow
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA war_TtlBotLandTwo active
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatD war_TtlBotLand active
execute as TtlBotNatD run ttl nation peace TtlBotLand
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA war_TtlBotLandTwo none
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatD war_TtlBotLand none
execute as TtlBotNatA run ttl nation info TtlBotLandTwo
# Dissolving nation 2 gives the owner the (empty) treasury back and clears the stages; the party itself stays until they leave.
execute as TtlBotNatD run ttl nation dissolve
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatD member no
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatE member no
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatE extra 0
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatE rankstage_hamlet no
# Cap 5: C, D, E join party 1 (five members), the sixth cannot (FTB Teams max_party_size). Nobody's nation rank changes size.
ttl nation test TtlBotNatE leaveparty
ttl nation test TtlBotNatD leaveparty
ttl as TtlBotNatA ftbteams party invite TtlBotNatC
ttl as TtlBotNatC ftbteams party join TtlBotNatA
ttl as TtlBotNatA ftbteams party invite TtlBotNatD
ttl as TtlBotNatD ftbteams party join TtlBotNatA
ttl as TtlBotNatA ftbteams party invite TtlBotNatE
ttl as TtlBotNatE ftbteams party join TtlBotNatA
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA members 5
ttl as TtlBotNatA ftbteams party invite TtlBotNatF
ttl as TtlBotNatF ftbteams party join TtlBotNatA
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA members 5
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatF member no
# Members who join are part of the nation; the limit is 5 x (4 base + 8 extra), and one who leaves loses stages and extra chunks.
ttl nation sync
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatE member yes
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatE extra 8
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA maxclaims 60
ttl nation test TtlBotNatE leaveparty
ttl nation sync
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatE member no
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatE extra 0
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatE rankstage_village no
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA members 4
# The owner dissolves: stages and extras go, the claim stays FTB's (unclaim it), the party stays.
execute as TtlBotNatA run ftbchunks unclaim
execute as TtlBotNatA run ttl nation dissolve
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatA member no
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatB member no
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatB extra 0
ttl nation expect TtlBotNatB rankstage_village no
# Leave the world as we found it (the 100 bonus renown each is taken back; a failed run leaves it, harmless for the _min checks).
ttl nation test TtlBotNatB leaveparty
ttl nation test TtlBotNatC leaveparty
ttl nation test TtlBotNatD leaveparty
ttl nation test TtlBotNatA leaveparty
ttl rep bonus TtlBotNatA -100
ttl rep bonus TtlBotNatB -100
ttlbot remove TtlBotNatA
ttlbot remove TtlBotNatB
ttlbot remove TtlBotNatC
ttlbot remove TtlBotNatD
ttlbot remove TtlBotNatE
ttlbot remove TtlBotNatF
